<title>BRAZIL: SOCCER-BRAZILIAN CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS/STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BRAZILIAN CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS/STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of weekend matches</p>
<p>in the Brazilian soccer championship:</p>
<p> Atletico Mineiro     1  Santos	   1</p>
<p> Atletico Paranaense  2  Palmeiras	0</p>
<p> Bragantino	     3  Coritiba	 1</p>
<p> Corinthians	    3  Fluminense     1</p>
<p> Criciuma		 1  Santos	   1</p>
<p> Flamengo		 1  Parana	   4</p>
<p> Goias		    6  Internacional  3</p>
<p> Gremio		   1  Juventude	0</p>
